<title>UK: Heywood ups Coldseal stake for 12 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Heywood ups Coldseal stake for 12 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Heywood Williams Group Plc said on Tuesday it had bought an added 30 percent stake in window maker Coldseal for 12 million stg in cash.</p>
<p>The deal raised its stake in Coldseal, based in Derbyshire, northern England, to 65 percent.</p>
<p>The unit's three selling shareholders and founders will retain their 35 percent stake in Coldseal, although they will have an option to require Heywood to buy their shares at a later date. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
